# Spells on objects and spells that make them, cast by Smokegod (60, every skill at 100, mana to spare), with only
# area_update running, at the entrance to Mud School (3700). Each cast is waited out.
# - continual light (a ball of light, a glow on something carried, already glowing, not carried); control weather
#   (better, worse, neither); create food, rose and spring
# - create water: into something that isn't a drink container, one with another liquid, and an empty one, which
#   gets "water" in its name
# - detect poison on plain food (a created mushroom) and poisoned food, and on a sword; fireproof twice
# - floating disc: one to wear, then refused, as a disc won't come off
# - enchant armor and enchant weapon cast again and again on one shield and one sword: each bonus makes failing
#   likelier, until the shield is destroyed and the sword's enchantments fade away; and refused for the wrong kind of item, and a worn shield isn't found
#   (do_cast looks only among what's carried, so the spell's own "must be carried" can't be reached this way)
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
cast 'continual light'
@pulse 24
@obj 3021 3700
get sword
cast 'continual light' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'continual light' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'continual light' nothing
@pulse 24
cast 'control weather' better
@pulse 24
cast 'control weather' worse
@pulse 24
cast 'control weather'
@pulse 24
cast 'create food'
@pulse 24
cast 'create rose'
@pulse 24
cast 'create spring'
@pulse 24
cast 'create water' sword
@pulse 24
@obj 611 3700
get milk
cast 'create water' milk
@pulse 24
@obj 611 3700 20 0 0 0 0
get milk
cast 'create water' milk
@pulse 24
@obj 20 3700 5 10 0 1 0
get mushroom
get mushroom
cast 'detect poison' mushroom
@pulse 24
cast 'detect poison' 2.mushroom
@pulse 24
cast 'detect poison' sword
@pulse 24
cast fireproof sword
@pulse 24
cast fireproof sword
@pulse 24
cast 'floating disc'
@pulse 24
cast 'floating disc'
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' milk
@pulse 24
@obj 3117 3700
get shield
wear shield
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
remove shield
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant armor' shield
@pulse 24
@obj 3021 3700
get sword
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
cast 'enchant weapon' sword
@pulse 24
@state
